#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Shidashi — catering of bentoo builds and ISOs."
msgstr "Shidashi — 承办 bentoo 的构建与 ISO。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Install completion for the current shell."
msgstr "为当前 shell 安装补全。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Show completion for the current shell, to copy it or customize the installation."
msgstr "显示当前 shell 的补全脚本，以便复制或自定义安装。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Resolve the recipe against the real tree via ``emerge --pretend`` (R1.1–R1.4).\n"
"\n"
"Success (even with reported cycles) → package list + suggestions and exit 0.\n"
"Known errors → friendly message + exit 1, no traceback. On a hard-conflict\n"
"(``ResolveError`` with ``raw_output``) the raw emerge output goes to stderr."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``emerge --pretend`` 对照真实的树解析配方（R1.1–R1.4）。\n"
"\n"
"成功（即使报告了循环）→ 软件包列表 + 建议，退出码 0。\n"
"已知错误 → 友好提示 + 退出码 1，不显示 traceback。发生硬冲突时\n"
"（带 ``raw_output`` 的 ``ResolveError``），原始 emerge 输出写入 stderr。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Output format: pretty (default) or json."
msgstr "输出格式：pretty（默认）或 json。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Use the cache only; never touch the network."
msgstr "仅使用缓存；绝不访问网络。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Keep the scratch rootfs after the run."
msgstr "运行结束后保留临时 rootfs。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Work root (cache+scratch under <DIR>)."
msgstr "工作根目录（缓存与临时目录位于 <DIR> 下）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Also print every line the build prints, as it runs."
msgstr "同时在运行过程中打印构建输出的每一行。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Build the recipe's binpkgs (stage4) in an nspawn container (R1.1–R1.5/R8.x).\n"
"\n"
"Without ``--step``/``--until``/``--reset`` it runs story 003's one-shot (R8.2);\n"
"any of them routes to the resumable step-by-step build (``--step`` makes it\n"
"interactive, with checkpoints and failure prompts). Success → report of\n"
"phases/atoms/fork point (+ ``stopped_at``/diffs in stepwise) + exit 0. Known\n"
"errors (``FactoryError``/``StaleStateError``/``SeedError``/``ResolveError``/\n"
"unknown axis/recipe conflict/invalid ``--until``), including the root guard,\n"
"become a friendly message + exit 1, no traceback; a ``FactoryError`` prints\n"
"the phase that failed and the emerge ``output``."
msgstr ""
"在 nspawn 容器中构建配方的 binpkg（stage4）（R1.1–R1.5/R8.x）。\n"
"\n"
"不带 ``--step``/``--until``/``--reset`` 时，运行 story 003 的一次性构建（R8.2）；\n"
"任一选项都会转到可恢复的分步构建（``--step`` 使其成为\n"
"交互式，带检查点和失败提示）。成功 → 报告\n"
"阶段/atom/分叉点（分步模式下另含 ``stopped_at``/差异）+ 退出码 0。已知\n"
"错误（``FactoryError``/``StaleStateError``/``SeedError``/``ResolveError``/\n"
"未知轴/配方冲突/无效的 ``--until``），包括 root 守卫，\n"
"会变为友好提示 + 退出码 1，不显示 traceback；``FactoryError`` 会打印\n"
"失败的阶段以及 emerge 的 ``output``。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Rebuild the whole tree (--emptytree, default) or reuse binpkgs."
msgstr "重新构建整个树（--emptytree，默认）或复用 binpkg。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Host-side output PKGDIR (default: per arch)."
msgstr "主机侧的输出 PKGDIR（默认：按架构）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Keep the scratch rootfs after the build."
msgstr "构建结束后保留临时 rootfs。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Interactive build: pause at a checkpoint after each phase."
msgstr "交互式构建：每个阶段结束后在检查点暂停。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Stop after the named phase (seed + the recipe's phases)."
msgstr "在指定阶段之后停止（seed + 配方的各阶段）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Discard the persisted state/rootfs and start over from scratch."
msgstr "丢弃已保存的状态/rootfs，从头开始。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Resume a stale state without starting over."
msgstr "恢复过期的状态，而不从头开始。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Work root: cache+scratch under <DIR> (beats SHIDASHI_CACHE/_SCRATCH)."
msgstr "工作根目录：缓存与临时目录位于 <DIR> 下（优先于 SHIDASHI_CACHE/_SCRATCH）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "This host's jobs, over the recipe's, in every phase: MAKEOPTS=-jN -lN and emerge --jobs=N --load-average=N."
msgstr "本主机的并行任务数，覆盖配方的设置，用于每个阶段：MAKEOPTS=-jN -lN 和 emerge --jobs=N --load-average=N。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Stop after this STAGE (its fork point written); the next run resumes there."
msgstr "在此 STAGE 之后停止（写入其分叉点）；下次运行从此处继续。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Weekly update of the built image within its generation (D26): -uDN --changed-deps over the pinned tree; refuses a toolchain change."
msgstr "在同一代内每周更新已构建的镜像（D26）：基于锁定的树执行 -uDN --changed-deps；拒绝工具链变更。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Assemble the recipe's live ISO from the binhost (OVERVIEW §7).\n"
"\n"
"Seeds a stage3, overlays the recipe's layers (final USE = that of the binpkgs,\n"
"§18.6), pulls the flavor's slice with ``emerge --usepkgonly`` and produces the\n"
"hybrid ISO (squashfs + dracut ``dmsquash-live`` + grub-mkrescue). Success →\n"
"ISO path + exit 0. Known errors (root guard, missing kernel, unknown\n"
"axis/recipe conflict, seed/resolve, emerge/dracut failure, squashfs/ISO\n"
"failure) become a friendly message + exit 1, no traceback."
msgstr ""
"从 binhost 组装配方的 live ISO（OVERVIEW §7）。\n"
"\n"
"播种一个 stage3，叠加配方的各层（最终 USE = binpkg 的 USE，\n"
"§18.6），用 ``emerge --usepkgonly`` 拉取该风格的切片，并生成\n"
"混合 ISO（squashfs + dracut ``dmsquash-live`` + grub-mkrescue）。成功 →\n"
"ISO 路径 + 退出码 0。已知错误（root 守卫、缺少内核、未知\n"
"轴/配方冲突、seed/resolve、emerge/dracut 失败、squashfs/ISO\n"
"失败）会变为友好提示 + 退出码 1，不显示 traceback。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Directory of the ISO(s) and their artifacts (bentoo-<date>-<flavor>-<init>-<arch>.iso, .DIGESTS, SHA256SUMS...)."
msgstr "ISO 及其附属文件的目录（bentoo-<date>-<flavor>-<init>-<arch>.iso、.DIGESTS、SHA256SUMS...）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "zstd (default: the faster live session), xz (the smaller download), or both (two ISOs)."
msgstr "zstd（默认：live 会话更快）、xz（下载更小）或 both（两个 ISO）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Also publish the configured system as a stage4 tarball (tar.xz, xz -9e), made before the live user is added."
msgstr "同时将配置好的系统发布为 stage4 tarball（tar.xz，xz -9e），在添加 live 用户之前制作。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Do not generate the SBOM (syft)."
msgstr "不生成 SBOM（syft）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Host-side output binhost (publish-pool) (default: per arch)."
msgstr "主机侧的输出 binhost（发布池）（默认：按架构）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Keep the scratch rootfs after the assembly."
msgstr "组装结束后保留临时 rootfs。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Restore no checkpoint, not even the trunk: install from the stage3 again."
msgstr "不恢复任何检查点，连主干也不恢复：重新从 stage3 安装。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Install a flavor whole from the stage3, not on top of its trunk (desktop)."
msgstr "从 stage3 完整安装一个风格，而不是在其主干（desktop）之上安装。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "emerge --jobs N (binpkgs merged in parallel), mksquashfs/unsquashfs -processors N and the stage4's xz -TN. Default: emerge one package at a time, the others on every CPU."
msgstr "emerge --jobs N（并行合并 binpkg）、mksquashfs/unsquashfs -processors N 以及 stage4 的 xz -TN。默认：emerge 一次合并一个软件包，其余工具使用全部 CPU。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Then boot the ISO on BIOS and UEFI and check it (shidashi vm test); a failed check fails the assemble."
msgstr "然后在 BIOS 和 UEFI 上启动该 ISO 并检查（shidashi vm test）；检查失败则组装失败。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "vsock CID of the --boot-test VM: the first one from N upward that no other boot test on this machine holds."
msgstr "--boot-test VM 的 vsock CID：从 N 开始向上，取本机上其他启动测试均未占用的第一个。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Build a tree of images in one audited run: the plan, the factory, then every ISO.\n"
"\n"
"``sudo shidashi build v3 systemd --images minimal,kde,gnome`` plans the images\n"
"across this host and the workers paired by the invoking user (story 010): each\n"
"image goes to the node estimated to finish the whole build first. The plan is\n"
"recorded in the build's audit trail (step ``plan``); ``--plan`` prints it and stops,\n"
"``--local`` keeps every image on this host. The factory then runs here (unless a\n"
"worker owns the arch's binhost), and every node builds its share at once: here one\n"
"``assemble`` process per image with its share of ``--jobs`` (``--serial``: one after\n"
"another, each with every job), on a worker one ``shidashi worker job``. A failed\n"
"image never stops the others: the build reports every image's node, duration and\n"
"ISOs or log, and exits 1 if any failed."
msgstr ""
"在一次审计的运行中构建一组镜像：计划、factory，然后是每个 ISO。\n"
"\n"
"``sudo shidashi build v3 systemd --images minimal,kde,gnome`` 将镜像规划到\n"
"本主机和调用用户配对的工作节点上（story 010）：每个\n"
"镜像分配给预计最先完成整个构建的节点。计划\n"
"记录在构建的审计记录中（步骤 ``plan``）；``--plan`` 打印计划后停止，\n"
"``--local`` 让所有镜像都留在本主机。随后 factory 在此运行（除非\n"
"某个工作节点拥有该架构的 binhost），各节点同时构建各自的部分：此处每个镜像\n"
"一个 ``assemble`` 进程，分得相应份额的 ``--jobs``（``--serial``：逐个\n"
"执行，每个使用全部任务数），工作节点上则是一个 ``shidashi worker job``。一个失败的\n"
"镜像绝不会阻止其他镜像：构建会报告每个镜像的节点、耗时以及\n"
"ISO 或日志，任一失败则退出码为 1。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Comma-separated images (minimal, kde, gnome...) or all."
msgstr "逗号分隔的镜像（minimal、kde、gnome...）或 all。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Directory of the ISOs and artifacts."
msgstr "ISO 及附属文件的目录。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "zstd, xz or both (two ISOs per image)."
msgstr "zstd、xz 或 both（每个镜像两个 ISO）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Also a stage4 per image."
msgstr "每个镜像另加一个 stage4。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "No SBOM (syft)."
msgstr "不生成 SBOM（syft）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Assemble from the binpkgs already built."
msgstr "从已构建的 binpkg 组装。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "In the factory MAKEOPTS -jN -lN and emerge --jobs=N --load-average=N; in the assemble emerge --jobs N, mksquashfs/unsquashfs -processors N and the stage4's xz -TN."
msgstr "factory 中为 MAKEOPTS -jN -lN 和 emerge --jobs=N --load-average=N；assemble 中为 emerge --jobs N、mksquashfs/unsquashfs -processors N 以及 stage4 的 xz -TN。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Keep the build rootfs."
msgstr "保留构建 rootfs。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Cache only; never touch the network."
msgstr "仅使用缓存；绝不访问网络。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Boot every ISO on BIOS and UEFI and check it (shidashi vm test); a failed check fails the build."
msgstr "在 BIOS 和 UEFI 上启动每个 ISO 并检查（shidashi vm test）；检查失败则构建失败。"

#: shidashi/cli.py shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Root of cache, scratch and runs."
msgstr "缓存、临时目录和运行记录的根目录。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Assemble the host's images one after another in one process, each with every job, instead of one concurrent `assemble` process per image."
msgstr "在一个进程中逐个组装本主机的镜像，每个使用全部任务数，而不是每个镜像一个并发的 `assemble` 进程。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Print which node builds each image, with its estimate, and exit without building."
msgstr "打印每个镜像由哪个节点构建及其预估，然后退出，不进行构建。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Build every image on this host; probe no worker."
msgstr "在本主机上构建所有镜像；不探测任何工作节点。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Let a worker take images although the working tree has uncommitted or untracked changes (a worker builds the last commit)."
msgstr "即使工作树有未提交或未跟踪的更改，也允许工作节点接收镜像（工作节点构建最新的 commit）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Write how this build ended, as JSON (used by shidashi release)."
msgstr "以 JSON 写出本次构建的结束情况（供 shidashi release 使用）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Used by shidashi release"
msgstr "供 shidashi release 使用"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Write (or check) every image's world file, variants/<stage>/world.<init>.\n"
"\n"
"The flat list of packages each image asks for, generated from the kits: the\n"
"other end of the set composition. Run it after changing a kit or a stage's\n"
"sets, and commit the diff with the change.\n"
"\n"
"With an image (``shidashi world kde systemd``) it writes nothing: it prints\n"
"that image's packages kit by kit, with the atoms ``exclude:`` takes out.\n"
"``base`` and ``desktop`` are accepted too: the stages images grow from.\n"
"Dependencies are not listed -- only what the image asks for."
msgstr ""
"写入（或检查）每个镜像的 world 文件 variants/<stage>/world.<init>。\n"
"\n"
"每个镜像所请求软件包的扁平列表，由套件生成：\n"
"即 set 组合的另一端。修改套件或某个 stage 的\n"
"set 之后运行它，并将差异随该更改一起 commit。\n"
"\n"
"指定镜像时（``shidashi world kde systemd``）不写入任何内容：它按套件\n"
"逐个打印该镜像的软件包，并列出被 ``exclude:`` 排除的 atom。\n"
"也接受 ``base`` 和 ``desktop``：镜像由这些 stage 衍生而来。\n"
"不列出依赖 —— 只列出镜像所请求的内容。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Print this image's (or stage's) packages instead of writing files."
msgstr "打印该镜像（或 stage）的软件包，而不写入文件。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Only this init (default: every init)."
msgstr "仅此 init（默认：所有 init）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Do not write: exit 1 if any world file is stale."
msgstr "不写入：若有任何 world 文件过时，则退出码为 1。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Check what this host must provide to build images and boot them.\n"
"\n"
"Needs no root and changes nothing. Exits 1 when something a build needs is\n"
"missing (``build``); what only ``shidashi vm`` needs (``vm``) and the\n"
"``optional`` tools are reported without failing."
msgstr ""
"检查本主机构建和启动镜像必须具备的条件。\n"
"\n"
"无需 root，不做任何更改。缺少构建所需的条件（``build``）时\n"
"退出码为 1；仅 ``shidashi vm`` 需要的（``vm``）和\n"
"``optional`` 工具只报告，不导致失败。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Work root to check (its filesystem)."
msgstr "要检查的工作根目录（其文件系统）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Find a worker announcing itself, pick it, type the code it shows, pair."
msgstr "查找正在广播自身的工作节点，选择它，输入它显示的代码，完成配对。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The worker's name (and hostname)."
msgstr "工作节点的名称（以及主机名）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "IPv4[:PORT] of the worker, skipping discovery (across networks)."
msgstr "工作节点的 IPv4[:PORT]，跳过发现（跨网络时）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Seconds to listen for workers."
msgstr "监听工作节点的秒数。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Pair a worker booted with this host's shidashi.trust."
msgstr "配对一个用本主机的 shidashi.trust 启动的工作节点。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Print this host's shidashi.trust kernel parameter."
msgstr "打印本主机的 shidashi.trust 内核参数。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Replace a worker already paired under this name with another host key."
msgstr "将此名称下已配对的工作节点替换为另一个主机密钥。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Inspect and validate resolved recipes."
msgstr "检查并验证解析后的配方。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Resolve, merge and render the recipe (R4.1–R4.3)."
msgstr "解析、合并并渲染配方（R4.1–R4.3）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Output format."
msgstr "输出格式。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Validate load+merge: success → exit 0; conflict/unknown axis → exit 1 (R5.1/R5.2)."
msgstr "验证加载+合并：成功 → 退出码 0；冲突/未知轴 → 退出码 1（R5.1/R5.2）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"List what can be asked for: arches, TARGETS (delivered images) and inits (R6.1).\n"
"\n"
"The target is ``minimal`` or a flavor (D24) -- not the ``flavor`` axis, where\n"
"``minimal`` no longer lives. The base is implicit: every chain starts there."
msgstr ""
"列出可请求的内容：架构、TARGETS（交付的镜像）和 init（R6.1）。\n"
"\n"
"目标为 ``minimal`` 或某个风格（D24）—— 而不是 ``flavor`` 轴，``minimal``\n"
"已不在该轴中。base 是隐含的：每条链都从那里开始。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Boot an ISO in a VM and drive it over SSH on vsock (no network, no screen)."
msgstr "在 VM 中启动 ISO，并通过 vsock 上的 SSH 操控它（无网络、无屏幕）。"

#: shidashi/vm_access_cli.py
msgid ""
"Print an ssh ``Host`` (``shidashi-NAME``) that lands as root in the VM, and keep it\n"
"beside the session as ``ssh_config``. One ``Include`` of\n"
"``~/.local/state/shidashi/vm/*/ssh_config`` in ``~/.ssh/config`` makes every session\n"
"that ran this reachable -- by an editor's remote project (Zeo, Zed, VS Code) or by\n"
"``ssh shidashi-NAME``. A session on a build worker is reached through the worker with\n"
"a key made here; it goes when the session is stopped."
msgstr ""
"打印一个以 root 身份登录 VM 的 ssh ``Host``（``shidashi-NAME``），并将其作为\n"
"``ssh_config`` 保存在会话旁。在 ``~/.ssh/config`` 中加入一行\n"
"``Include`` ``~/.local/state/shidashi/vm/*/ssh_config``，即可让每个运行过此命令的\n"
"会话都可访问 —— 通过编辑器的远程项目（Zeo、Zed、VS Code）或\n"
"``ssh shidashi-NAME``。构建工作节点上的会话经由该工作节点访问，使用\n"
"在此生成的密钥；会话停止时密钥随之删除。"

#: shidashi/vm_access_cli.py
msgid ""
"Set a variable in the VM from stdin, for every login shell there -- the\n"
"environment an editor's remote server and its agents start from. The value never\n"
"is a command-line word and never reaches a disk: it is kept in RAM in the guest\n"
"(``/run``, mode 0600) and goes with the VM. Pipe it in, e.g.\n"
"``secret-tool lookup service anthropic purpose X | shidashi vm env --name dev\n"
"CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN``."
msgstr ""
"从 stdin 在 VM 中设置一个变量，供其中的每个登录 shell 使用 —— 即\n"
"编辑器的远程服务器及其代理启动时的环境。该值绝不会\n"
"作为命令行参数出现，也绝不写入磁盘：它保存在客户机的 RAM 中\n"
"（``/run``，权限 0600），随 VM 一同消失。通过管道传入，例如\n"
"``secret-tool lookup service anthropic purpose X | shidashi vm env --name dev\n"
"CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN``。"

#: shidashi/vm_access_cli.py
msgid "The variable's name, e.g. CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN."
msgstr "变量的名称，例如 CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN。"

#: shidashi/vm_access_cli.py
msgid "Join stdin and stdout to the guest's sshd on vsock (a ``ProxyCommand``)."
msgstr "将 stdin 和 stdout 连接到客户机 vsock 上的 sshd（一个 ``ProxyCommand``）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Start ``iso`` in a VM reachable with `shidashi vm run`."
msgstr "在 VM 中启动 ``iso``，可通过 `shidashi vm run` 访问。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The ISO to boot (optional with --dev)."
msgstr "要启动的 ISO（使用 --dev 时可选）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Boot with OVMF instead of BIOS."
msgstr "使用 OVMF 而非 BIOS 启动。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Session name."
msgstr "会话名称。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The guest's vsock CID (default 42)."
msgstr "客户机的 vsock CID（默认 42）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The guest's memory (default 8G)."
msgstr "客户机的内存（默认 8G）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The guest's processors (default 8)."
msgstr "客户机的处理器数（默认 8）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "none (headless) or sdl to watch it."
msgstr "none（无界面）或 sdl（可观看画面）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Wait for SSH."
msgstr "等待 SSH 就绪。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "A qcow2 disk for the guest (/dev/vda, vdb...); repeatable."
msgstr "客户机的 qcow2 磁盘（/dev/vda、vdb...）；可重复。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Create a missing --disk with this size (e.g. 200G)."
msgstr "以此大小创建缺失的 --disk（例如 200G）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "TAG=DIR[:rw]: a host directory the guest mounts with `mount -t virtiofs TAG <dir>`; read-only unless :rw. Repeatable."
msgstr "TAG=DIR[:rw]：客户机用 `mount -t virtiofs TAG <dir>` 挂载的主机目录；除非指定 :rw，否则只读。可重复。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Make the guest's TCP port GUEST reachable on the host's 127.0.0.1:HOST (e.g. 2222:22). Repeatable."
msgstr "使客户机的 TCP 端口 GUEST 可在主机的 127.0.0.1:HOST 上访问（例如 2222:22）。可重复。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "A VM ready to build ebuilds (bentoolkit): the ISO's pinned trees, a fresh work disk, /var/db/repos/staged, a binhost; prints one JSON line. Exit 3: no ISO."
msgstr "一个可构建 ebuild 的 VM（bentoolkit）：ISO 的锁定树、全新的工作磁盘、/var/db/repos/staged、一个 binhost；打印一行 JSON。退出码 3：无 ISO。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "--dev: this ISO, not the newest minimal."
msgstr "--dev：使用此 ISO，而不是最新的 minimal。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "--dev: the ISO's init."
msgstr "--dev：该 ISO 的 init。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "--dev: the ISO's arch."
msgstr "--dev：该 ISO 的架构。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "--dev: after HOURS (fractions allowed) the session powers itself off and is removed, as `vm stop` does; without it, never."
msgstr "--dev：HOURS 小时后（允许小数）会话自行关机并被移除，与 `vm stop` 相同；不指定则永不。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "--dev: run the VM on this paired build worker (default: the one SHIDASHI_DEV_WORKER names); `vm run` and `vm stop` then reach it there."
msgstr "--dev：在此已配对的构建工作节点上运行 VM（默认：SHIDASHI_DEV_WORKER 指定的那个）；之后 `vm run` 和 `vm stop` 会到那里访问它。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "--dev: on this host, whatever SHIDASHI_DEV_WORKER names."
msgstr "--dev：在本主机上运行，无论 SHIDASHI_DEV_WORKER 指定了什么。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Run a command as root in the VM; its exit code becomes ours. Our stdin is the\n"
"command's (``tar -c … | shidashi vm run -- tar -x``). A command stopped by\n"
"``--timeout``, Ctrl+C, SIGTERM or SIGHUP is stopped in the guest too, with all it\n"
"started; past its timeout it exits 124, on a signal 128 + its number. A session\n"
"started on a build worker (``vm start --dev --worker``) is reached there."
msgstr ""
"在 VM 中以 root 身份运行命令；其退出码即为我们的退出码。我们的 stdin 即\n"
"该命令的 stdin（``tar -c … | shidashi vm run -- tar -x``）。被\n"
"``--timeout``、Ctrl+C、SIGTERM 或 SIGHUP 停止的命令，在客户机中也会连同它启动的\n"
"所有进程一起停止；超时后退出码为 124，收到信号时为 128 + 信号编号。在构建\n"
"工作节点上启动的会话（``vm start --dev --worker``）会到那里访问。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The command, run by the guest's shell."
msgstr "命令，由客户机的 shell 运行。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Seconds before giving up on the command; 0: no limit."
msgstr "放弃该命令前的秒数；0：无限制。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Pass the output through line by line as the guest writes it, instead of when the command ends."
msgstr "在客户机写出输出时逐行转发，而不是等命令结束后再输出。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Save the VM's screen (PNG) -- for when looking is really needed."
msgstr "保存 VM 的屏幕（PNG）—— 用于确实需要看一眼的时候。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Power the VM off; a ``--dev`` session's directory, work disk included, goes too.\n"
"A session on a build worker is stopped there, and forgotten when it is gone."
msgstr ""
"关闭 VM；``--dev`` 会话的目录（包括工作磁盘）也一并删除。\n"
"构建工作节点上的会话在那里停止，消失后即被遗忘。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"The automated boot test: boot ``iso`` and check what its system.yaml declared.\n"
"\n"
"Audited like a build, the report attached as boot-test.json. Exit 1 when any\n"
"check fails. Natively the run also records the steps boot:<firmware> and\n"
"check:<name>; on a node without QEMU the boot test runs in the v3-systemd\n"
"toolbox container (:mod:`shidashi.vmrunner`), whose inner steps are not\n"
"recorded -- the boot-test attachment carries every check's result, the metrics\n"
"and the ssh time per firmware all the same. The CID lock is held here, around\n"
"either."
msgstr ""
"自动启动测试：启动 ``iso`` 并检查其 system.yaml 声明的内容。\n"
"\n"
"像构建一样被审计，报告以附件 boot-test.json 保存。任一\n"
"检查失败时退出码为 1。在本机运行时还会记录步骤 boot:<firmware> 和\n"
"check:<name>；在没有 QEMU 的节点上，启动测试在 v3-systemd\n"
"toolbox 容器（:mod:`shidashi.vmrunner`）中运行，其内部步骤不会\n"
"被记录 —— 但 boot-test 附件同样包含每项检查的结果、指标\n"
"以及每种固件的 ssh 时间。CID 锁在此处持有，涵盖\n"
"这两种情况。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "bios, uefi or both."
msgstr "bios、uefi 或 both。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Also save a screenshot per boot here."
msgstr "同时在此处为每次启动保存一张截图。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"The runner container's side of a boot test: ``vm.boot_test`` into ``--report``.\n"
"\n"
"No CID lock (the outer caller holds it host-wide; this container's ``/tmp`` is not\n"
"the host's) and no audit run (the outer run records the report). Exit 0 with the\n"
"report written, whatever its ``passed``; on any exception ``{\"error\": <text>}`` is\n"
"written instead and the exit is 2 -- an error is never a verdict."
msgstr ""
"启动测试在 runner 容器一侧的部分：``vm.boot_test`` 写入 ``--report``。\n"
"\n"
"不持 CID 锁（外层调用者在整台主机范围持有；此容器的 ``/tmp`` 不是\n"
"主机的）且不运行审计（外层运行会记录报告）。写入报告后退出码为 0，\n"
"无论其 ``passed`` 如何；出现任何异常时改为写入 ``{\"error\": <text>}``，\n"
"退出码为 2 —— 错误绝不是判定结果。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Where the JSON report lands."
msgstr "JSON 报告的存放位置。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The runner container's side of ``vm.read_build_info``: the ISO's build.json as JSON."
msgstr "``vm.read_build_info`` 在 runner 容器一侧的部分：以 JSON 输出 ISO 的 build.json。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The kit library: every package Bentoo builds."
msgstr "套件库：Bentoo 构建的所有软件包。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Every kit atom must exist in the pinned trees; every @ref must name a kit.\n"
"\n"
"Read-only. Exit 1 with one line per problem (kit:line: atom -- why)."
msgstr ""
"每个套件 atom 都必须存在于锁定的树中；每个 @ref 都必须指向一个套件。\n"
"\n"
"只读。退出码 1，每个问题一行（kit:line: atom -- 原因）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Use the cached pinned trees only."
msgstr "仅使用已缓存的锁定树。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Drive a paired worker (shidashi kyomei)."
msgstr "操控已配对的工作节点（shidashi kyomei）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Give worker NAME its identity and a personalized ISO that boots already paired."
msgstr "为工作节点 NAME 生成身份，以及一个启动即已配对的个性化 ISO。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The worker's name (one RFC 1123 label)."
msgstr "工作节点的名称（一个 RFC 1123 标签）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The generic worker ISO to personalize."
msgstr "要个性化的通用工作节点 ISO。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Replace NAME's identity (a lost medium)."
msgstr "替换 NAME 的身份（介质丢失时）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Join this WPA-PSK Wi-Fi network at boot; the passphrase is asked without echo on a terminal, else read as one line from stdin."
msgstr "启动时加入此 WPA-PSK Wi-Fi 网络；在终端上以不回显方式询问密码，否则从 stdin 读取一行。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Make DISK the worker's SHIDASHI-WORK disk -- only with its serial confirmed."
msgstr "将 DISK 设为工作节点的 SHIDASHI-WORK 磁盘 —— 仅在确认其序列号后。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The paired worker's name."
msgstr "已配对工作节点的名称。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The disk to prepare, e.g. /dev/sda."
msgstr "要准备的磁盘，例如 /dev/sda。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The disk's serial (lsblk -o NAME,SERIAL)."
msgstr "磁盘的序列号（lsblk -o NAME,SERIAL）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"A worker's CPU, targets, load, memory, work disk, image, SMART, checkpoints and\n"
"jobs; without a name, one line per paired worker (at most 5 s each)."
msgstr ""
"工作节点的 CPU、目标、负载、内存、工作磁盘、镜像、SMART、检查点和\n"
"任务；不指定名称时，每个已配对工作节点一行（每个最多 5 秒）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "A paired worker's name; every one when omitted."
msgstr "已配对工作节点的名称；省略时为全部。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Reach the worker there, without the mDNS lookup; recorded once it answers with its pinned key."
msgstr "直接到该地址访问工作节点，不进行 mDNS 查找；一旦它以锁定的密钥应答即记录下来。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Run COMMAND on the worker, every argument quoted; its output streams here and\n"
"its exit code is ours."
msgstr ""
"在工作节点上运行 COMMAND，每个参数都加引号；其输出流式传回此处，\n"
"其退出码即为我们的退出码。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The command and its arguments (after --)."
msgstr "命令及其参数（在 -- 之后）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Print a job's log; with -f, follow it until the job ends."
msgstr "打印任务的日志；使用 -f 时持续跟踪，直到任务结束。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The job's name."
msgstr "任务的名称。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Follow the log until the job ends."
msgstr "持续跟踪日志，直到任务结束。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Release ARCH's owner lock once its holder -- a worker job, or a host build by its\n"
"pid -- has ended; with --force, now."
msgstr ""
"在持有者（工作节点任务，或按 pid 识别的主机构建）结束后，释放 ARCH 的所有者锁；\n"
"使用 --force 则立即释放。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The arch whose owner lock to release."
msgstr "要释放其所有者锁的架构。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Release it without checking that its holder has ended."
msgstr "释放它，不检查其持有者是否已结束。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Keep ARCH's binpkgs, fork points, distfiles and ccache on WORKER only; with\n"
"--off, under the host again; without --arch, list what WORKER owns. Nothing is\n"
"copied or deleted on either side."
msgstr ""
"仅在 WORKER 上保存 ARCH 的 binpkg、分叉点、distfiles 和 ccache；使用\n"
"--off 则重新放回主机下；不带 --arch 时，列出 WORKER 拥有的内容。双方都\n"
"不会复制或删除任何内容。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The arch whose cache stays on WORKER."
msgstr "缓存保存在 WORKER 上的架构。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Bring ARCH's cache back under the host."
msgstr "将 ARCH 的缓存重新放回主机下。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Power the worker off; refused while a Shidashi job runs on it, unless --force."
msgstr "关闭工作节点；其上有 Shidashi 任务运行时拒绝，除非使用 --force。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Power off even while a Shidashi job runs."
msgstr "即使有 Shidashi 任务在运行也关机。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Run ``shidashi ARGS…`` on the worker from this checkout's HEAD: follow its log,\n"
"bring its results back and exit with its exit code."
msgstr ""
"以此 checkout 的 HEAD 在工作节点上运行 ``shidashi ARGS…``：跟踪其日志，\n"
"取回其结果，并以其退出码退出。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The job's name: a-z, 0-9 and '-' only."
msgstr "任务的名称：仅限 a-z、0-9 和 '-'。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The shidashi command and its arguments (after --)."
msgstr "shidashi 命令及其参数（在 -- 之后）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Run HEAD although the checkout has uncommitted changes (they are not shipped)."
msgstr "即使 checkout 有未提交的更改也运行 HEAD（这些更改不会被传送）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Start the job and return; follow and pull it later."
msgstr "启动任务后立即返回；稍后再跟踪并拉取。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Where its log, rc and ISOs land (default ./worker-results/NAME/JOB)."
msgstr "其日志、rc 和 ISO 的存放位置（默认 ./worker-results/NAME/JOB）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Cap every transfer at K KiB/s."
msgstr "将每次传输限速为 K KiB/s。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Copy an arch's cache to a worker, and results back from it."
msgstr "将某架构的缓存复制到工作节点，并从中取回结果。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Send the worker ARCH's cache -- PKGDIR, distfiles and ccache, the pinned\n"
"trees and repositories, the stage3 and the fork points -- and the runtime venv."
msgstr ""
"向工作节点发送 ARCH 的缓存 —— PKGDIR、distfiles 和 ccache、锁定的\n"
"树和仓库、stage3 和分叉点 —— 以及运行时 venv。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The arch whose cache to send."
msgstr "要发送其缓存的架构。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The init whose stage3 generation to send."
msgstr "要发送其 stage3 代的 init。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid ""
"Bring back ARCH's new distfiles and ccache entries and, with --job, that job's\n"
"log, rc, runs and ISOs. The binhost comes back, and the arch's owner lock is\n"
"released, only for the lock holder's job once it has ended."
msgstr ""
"取回 ARCH 新的 distfiles 和 ccache 条目，使用 --job 时还取回该任务的\n"
"日志、rc、运行记录和 ISO。仅对锁持有者的任务、且在其结束后，binhost 才会取回，\n"
"该架构的所有者锁也才会释放。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The arch whose caches come back (omit only for an archless job)."
msgstr "其缓存要取回的架构（仅无架构的任务可省略）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The init whose stage3 generation the binhost is."
msgstr "binhost 所属 stage3 代的 init。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The job whose log, rc, runs and ISOs come back (./worker-results/)."
msgstr "要取回其日志、rc、运行记录和 ISO 的任务（./worker-results/）。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Where the job's log, rc, runs and ISOs land (default ./worker-results/NAME/JOB); needs --job."
msgstr "任务的日志、rc、运行记录和 ISO 的存放位置（默认 ./worker-results/NAME/JOB）；需要 --job。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The build pool: classify, trim and publish binpkgs."
msgstr "构建池：分类、修剪并发布 binpkg。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Print each binpkg instance with its kind (final, transient, old, unrecorded)."
msgstr "打印每个 binpkg 实例及其类别（final、transient、old、unrecorded）。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Microarchitecture whose pool to read (e.g. v3)."
msgstr "要读取其池的微架构（例如 v3）。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Init flavor whose PKGDIR and toolbox to use."
msgstr "要使用其 PKGDIR 和 toolbox 的 init 类型。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Generation (stage3 snapshot) to read; default is the one factory builds."
msgstr "要读取的代（stage3 快照）；默认为 factory 构建的那一代。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Quarantine the binpkgs whose ebuild is gone, beyond --keep per package, and reindex."
msgstr "隔离 ebuild 已不存在的 binpkg（每个软件包超出 --keep 的部分），并重建索引。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Newest CPVs kept per (package, SLOT) once gone."
msgstr "ebuild 消失后，每个（软件包, SLOT）保留的最新 CPV 数量。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Print the planned PATHs; move and write nothing."
msgstr "打印计划的 PATH；不移动、不写入任何内容。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "A CPV (cat/pkg-1.0) to quarantine too, whatever its ebuild: for a binpkg built from an overlay that dropped it while ::gentoo still ships the CPV."
msgstr "额外隔离的 CPV（cat/pkg-1.0），不论其 ebuild 如何：用于从某个已删除它的 overlay 构建、而 ::gentoo 仍提供该 CPV 的 binpkg。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Build the signed publish pool of one generation: its recorded finals, and no more."
msgstr "构建某一代的已签名发布池：仅包含其已记录的 final，别无其他。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Fingerprint of the maintainer's key that signs."
msgstr "用于签名的维护者密钥指纹。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Where the signed pool is made; default <cache>/publish/<arch>/<generation>."
msgstr "已签名池的生成位置；默认 <cache>/publish/<arch>/<generation>。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Check every signature of the publish pool against --pubkey; exit 1 on any failure."
msgstr "用 --pubkey 检查发布池的每个签名；任一失败则退出码为 1。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "Armored public key file: the only key trusted."
msgstr "ASCII-armored 公钥文件：唯一受信任的密钥。"

#: shidashi/binhost_cli.py
msgid "The signed pool to check; default <cache>/publish/<arch>/<generation>."
msgstr "要检查的已签名池；默认 <cache>/publish/<arch>/<generation>。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "The restore points: tarballs of finished build stages."
msgstr "还原点：已完成构建 stage 的 tarball。"

#: shidashi/fork_points_cli.py
msgid "Delete the fork points of every pin but the current one and the --keep newest others."
msgstr "删除所有锁定版本的分叉点，但保留当前锁定版本及 --keep 个最新的其他锁定版本。"

#: shidashi/fork_points_cli.py
msgid "Microarchitecture whose fork points to collect (e.g. v3)."
msgstr "要回收其分叉点的微架构（例如 v3）。"

#: shidashi/fork_points_cli.py
msgid "Other pins whose fork points stay besides the current pin's, newest first."
msgstr "除当前锁定版本外，其分叉点也予以保留的其他锁定版本，按最新优先。"

#: shidashi/fork_points_cli.py
msgid "Print the plan; delete nothing, take no lock."
msgstr "打印计划；不删除任何内容，不获取锁。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "GitHub calls from the host: runner config, dispatch."
msgstr "从主机发起的 GitHub 调用：runner 配置、dispatch。"

#: shidashi/ci_cli.py
msgid "Print the encoded JIT configuration of a new one-job runner (stdout, nothing else)."
msgstr "打印新的单任务 runner 的编码 JIT 配置（输出到 stdout，别无其他）。"

#: shidashi/ci_cli.py
msgid "OWNER/NAME of the repository."
msgstr "仓库的 OWNER/NAME。"

#: shidashi/ci_cli.py
msgid "File holding the token: yours, mode 0600 or 0400."
msgstr "保存令牌的文件：属于你，权限 0600 或 0400。"

#: shidashi/ci_cli.py
msgid "Label the runner carries."
msgstr "runner 携带的标签。"

#: shidashi/ci_cli.py
msgid "Name the runner registers as."
