msgstr "要将 OVMF 复制到的目录。"

#: shidashi/cli.py
msgid "Build, sign and report one dated release."
msgstr "构建、签名并报告一个带日期的发布版。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid ""
"Build every variant asked for, publish each arch's binhost, and sign one dated release.\n"
"\n"
"``sudo shidashi release v3 systemd --key FPR`` (or ``--unsigned``) runs one\n"
"``shidashi build --images all`` per variant into ``<cache>/releases/<YYYY.MM.DD>`` (the\n"
"start date in UTC), publishes the signed binhost of each arch that built, writes\n"
"``release.json`` and signs ``SHA256SUMS`` and every ``DIGESTS`` with the maintainer's\n"
"key. Exit 0 only when every variant built, published and the signatures verified;\n"
"``--unsigned`` publishes and signs\n"
"nothing and exits 0 when every variant built."
msgstr ""
"构建所请求的每个变体，发布每个架构的 binhost，并签名一个带日期的发布版。\n"
"\n"
"``sudo shidashi release v3 systemd --key FPR``（或 ``--unsigned``）为每个变体运行一次\n"
"``shidashi build --images all``，输出到 ``<cache>/releases/<YYYY.MM.DD>``（\n"
"UTC 开始日期），发布每个已构建架构的已签名 binhost，写入\n"
"``release.json``，并用维护者的密钥对 ``SHA256SUMS`` 和每个 ``DIGESTS``\n"
"签名。仅当每个变体都已构建、已发布且签名均已验证时退出码为 0；\n"
"``--unsigned`` 不发布、\n"
"不签名任何内容，每个变体都构建成功时退出码为 0。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Arch axis (e.g. v3); not with --all."
msgstr "架构轴（例如 v3）；不可与 --all 同用。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Init axis (systemd, openrc); not with --all."
msgstr "init 轴（systemd、openrc）；不可与 --all 同用。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Release every arch × init of the recipe axes."
msgstr "发布配方各轴的每个架构 × init 组合。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Parent of the dated release directories; default <cache>/releases."
msgstr "带日期发布目录的父目录；默认 <cache>/releases。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Boot-test every ISO (build --boot-test)."
msgstr "对每个 ISO 进行启动测试（build --boot-test）。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Cache only: no upstream stage3 check, no fetch in the builds."
msgstr "仅用缓存：不检查上游 stage3，构建中不下载。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Passed to every build."
msgstr "传递给每次构建。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Comma list of images every build makes (default all)."
msgstr "每次构建生成的镜像，逗号分隔（默认 all）。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "Fingerprint of the maintainer's key that signs the release."
msgstr "用于签名发布版的维护者密钥指纹。"

#: shidashi/release_cli.py
msgid "No key: skip the binhost publish and the signature; sign later on the host."
msgstr "无密钥：跳过 binhost 发布和签名；稍后在主机上签名。"

#: shidashi/release_prune_cli.py
msgid "Move every release but the newest --keep into <root>/.pruned; delete only on request."
msgstr "将除最新 --keep 个以外的所有发布版移入 <root>/.pruned；仅在要求时删除。"

