msgid "Releases that stay in the root."
msgstr "保留在根目录中的发布版数量。"

#: shidashi/release_prune_cli.py
msgid "Parent of the dated releases; default <cache>/releases."
msgstr "带日期发布版的父目录；默认 <cache>/releases。"

#: shidashi/release_prune_cli.py
msgid "Print the plan; move and delete nothing."
msgstr "打印计划；不移动、不删除任何内容。"

#: shidashi/release_prune_cli.py
msgid "Also delete the .pruned entries beyond --keep."
msgstr "同时删除超出 --keep 的 .pruned 条目。"

#: shidashi/release_publish_cli.py
msgid ""
"Sign an unsigned release in place, as `shidashi release --key` would have, and\n"
"verify every signature; exit 0 only once they all verified."
msgstr ""
"像 `shidashi release --key` 那样就地签名一个未签名的发布版，并\n"
"验证每个签名；仅当全部验证通过后退出码为 0。"

