msgid "A release directory made with `shidashi release --unsigned`."
msgstr "用 `shidashi release --unsigned` 生成的发布目录。"

#: shidashi/release_publish_cli.py
msgid "Fingerprint of the maintainer's key that signs it."
msgstr "用于对其签名的维护者密钥指纹。"

#: shidashi/release_publish_cli.py
msgid ""
"Verify a signed release, copy its public files to the bucket (signatures last),\n"
"rewrite the public index, then delete from the bucket the releases beyond --keep."
msgstr ""
"验证已签名的发布版，将其公开文件复制到存储桶（签名最后复制），\n"
"重写公开索引，然后从存储桶中删除超出 --keep 的发布版。"

